            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## 📊 Key Insights\n",
                "\n",
                "**1. Electronics Lead Revenue** - Electronics category generates $20,030 (42% of total revenue), significantly outperforming Beauty ($15,485) and Clothing ($12,105)\n",
                "\n",
                "**2. Strong Customer Base** - 100 transactions from 100 unique customers indicates each customer made exactly 1 purchase - significant retention opportunity\n",
                "\n",
                "**3. Revenue Volatility** - Monthly revenue varies significantly (peak: May $7,955, low: September $50), suggesting seasonal patterns or inventory issues\n",
                "\n",
                "**4. Gender Distribution** - Sales split between Male ($25,515) and Female ($22,105), relatively balanced market\n",
                "\n",
                "**5. Prime Age Group** - 35-44 age group dominates spending ($15,875), followed by 25-34 ($13,410) - focus on working professionals\n",
                "\n",
                "## 💡 Recommendations\n",
                "\n",
                "• **Launch Loyalty Program** - Zero repeat customers signals urgent need for retention initiatives\n",
                "• **Stabilize Inventory** - Address September revenue drop and seasonal fluctuations with better stock planning\n",
                "• **Expand Electronics** - Invest in top-performing category with targeted promotions and expanded product lines\n",
                "• **Target 35-44 Demographic** - Develop marketing campaigns for this high-value segment\n",
                "• **Cross-Sell Strategy** - Average 1.8 items per transaction shows opportunity to bundle products and increase basket size"
              ]
            }
          },
